# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
# 注意：下面的前导斜杠只匹配根目录，子项目的依赖要靠下面这两条
/node_modules
# services/signer 是独立包，依赖不能跟着提交
node_modules/
services/signer/dist/
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files
# 密钥一律排除。.example 模板要提交，所以下面反选回来
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
